<person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cerroni</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Barnhill</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Elder</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Gottlieb</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Heenan</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Kutzner</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><etal/></person-group>. <article-title>Melanocytic Tumors of Uncertain Malignant Potential: Results of a Tutorial Held at the XXIX Symposium of the International Society of Dermatopathology in Graz, October 2008</article-title>. <source>Am J Surg Pathol</source> (<year>2010</year>) <volume>34</volume>:<page-range>314&#x02013;26</page-range>. &#x000a0;<pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/PAS.0b013e3181cf7fa0</pub-id>
</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B5"><label>5</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">
